+
+**Architecture:** Normalize quotes in a shared text module. Validate curriculum, level2, and manual input before opening a database; run sample cleanup, content upserts, and count checks atomically. Dry runs migrate and import into an in-memory copy only. Keep existing CSV and seeding APIs compatible.
+
+**Execution:** Inline in the existing approved feature branch; no commits or worktrees. The user task book is the approved design. Tests use in-memory databases or disposable files below `test/`.
