+- [x] Add failing curriculum parsing, dictionary resolution, validation, migration, transaction, cleanup, idempotency, and dry-run tests; implement import and schema changes (R1, R2, R6–R8).
+- [x] Add failing priority/interleaving and pending-card-order tests; implement fresh-card selection without changing queue counts (R6).
+- [x] Preserve all existing assertions except explicitly approved case-sensitive dedup/count adjustments. Verify seed-due using an in-memory database and typecheck its script.
+- [x] Document CLI options in import.ts and data/wordlists/README.md.
+- [ ] Run npm test and npm run typecheck, then the exact real-input dry-run command; verify nonexistent DB was not created and review the final diff.
+- [ ] Deliver file/change/test summaries, complete real-input JSON, any limitations, and one optional Wiki archive reminder. Do not archive without confirmation.
+
+## Verification status
+
